ass=\"BVRRValue BVRRUserNickname\"><span itemprop=\"author\" class=\"BVRRNickname\">Adam McNine <\/span><\/span> <span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserNicknameSuffix\">,<\/span>\n<div class=\"BVRRUserLocationContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserLocationPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRUserLocation\">Easley, SC<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserLocationSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVDI_BA BVDI_BAReview\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInside\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BABody\"><ul class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><li class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOdd BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\"><div id=\"BVDI_BAPopup_9qeck2ekjtt1fuj3yb5e7xzd9_ID\" class=\"BVDIPopup BVDI_BAPopup BVDI_BAPopupVerifiedPurchaser\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_u4l304o61p1zaz7vj43l6kohk_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_9qeck2ekjtt1fuj3yb5e7xzd9_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRRecommendedContainer BVRRRecommendedContainerYes\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRecommendedPrefix\">Recommends this product? <\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRRecommended\">Yes<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRecommendedSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><div class=\"BVRRContextDataValueContainer BVRRContextDataValueGenderContainer BVContextDataGenderMale\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValuePrefix BVRRContextDataValueGenderPrefix\">Gender:<\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRContextDataValue BVRRContextDataValueGender\">Male<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValueSuffix BVRRContextDataValueGenderSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Simple, Easy, and Awesome<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">07/08/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-07-08\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText397451654_ag88pnnworcegahzwux75kxpw_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">X7 arrived the next day for me. Setup was straight forward. Setting the mowing zones with no go areas etc. was simple and quick. When it started mowing I anticipated their might be issues but the mower handled all the areas and trees that I did not<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText397451654_ag88pnnworcegahzwux75kxpw_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview397451654_79ubxb2emcbt5o1ue8v0skfaf_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview397451654_79ubxb2emcbt5o1ue8v0skfaf_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">X7 arrived the next day for me. Setup was straight forward. Setting the mowing zones with no go areas etc. was simple and quick. When it started mowing I anticipated their might be issues but the mower handled all the areas and trees that I did not mark fine. It has completed numerous complete mowings and required no assistance. Everyone in the neighborhood slows down to watch it working. I would definitely recommend the Sunseeker to everyone.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText397451654_ag88pnnworcegahzwux75kxpw_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview397451654_79ubxb2emcbt5o1ue8v0skfaf_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeClientResponseContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n \n \n\n\n\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Spacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3SpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n <\/div>\n<div id=\"BVDI_CO397451654ID\" class=\"BVDI BVDI_CO BVDI_CONoComments\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_COInside\"><div class=\"BVDIHeader BVDI_COHeader\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorContentBodyBottom\"><\/div><\/span><\/div><div id=\"BVRRDisplayContentReviewID_387346212\" class=\"BVRRContentReview BVRRDisplayContentReview BVDIContentSyndicated BVRRContentReviewSyndicated BVDI_BAContentVerifiedPurchaser BVRRDisplayContentReviewEven BVRREven\"><span itemprop=\"review\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Review\"><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorContentBodyTop\"><\/div>\n\n <div id=\"BVSubmissionPopupContainer\" class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Spacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3SpacerTop\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRSyndicatedContentAttribution BVRRSyndicatedReviewAttribution\"><div class=\"BVRRSyndicatedContentSource\">Written by a customer while visiting <span class=BVRRCustomSourceNameTag> shopsunseekertech.com\n<\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSyndicatedContentSourceLogo\"> <img src=\"https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg/a15a3c93-3b04-42ad-8ff8-e2595c323f1d\" alt=\"shopsunseekertech.com\" />\n<\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Summary\">\n<div class=\"BVRRUserNicknameContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserNicknamePrefix\">By <\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRUserNickname\"><span itemprop=\"author\" class=\"BVRRNickname\">Jake M <\/span><\/span> <span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserNicknameSuffix\">,<\/span>\n<div class=\"BVRRUserLocationContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserLocationPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRUserLocation\">North Carolina<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRUserLocationSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVDI_BA BVDI_BAReview\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInside\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BABody\"><ul class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><li class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOdd BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\"><div id=\"BVDI_BAPopup_enwuyl6hzuow37c0llv1g7ww4_ID\" class=\"BVDIPopup BVDI_BAPopup BVDI_BAPopupVerifiedPurchaser\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_e3l0z1r096rlv8yd5n4tozdsz_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_enwuyl6hzuow37c0llv1g7ww4_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div clas