itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-05-15\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387346212_3hopspjppqtt3fn66s7qhh2d9_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">Mows well but has a lot of errors and mechanical issues. Support has been mixed. The app is confusing but does decent enough once you know how to use it. It does throw a lot of errors regarding the bumper and RTK initializing. The mower does a good<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387346212_3hopspjppqtt3fn66s7qhh2d9_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview387346212_dk6uwqrwtvc32jjp6n473ekei_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview387346212_dk6uwqrwtvc32jjp6n473ekei_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Mows well but has a lot of errors and mechanical issues. Support has been mixed. The app is confusing but does decent enough once you know how to use it. It does throw a lot of errors regarding the bumper and RTK initializing. The mower does a good job for the most part though<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387346212_3hopspjppqtt3fn66s7qhh2d9_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview387346212_dk6uwqrwtvc32jjp6n473ekei_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeClientResponseContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n \n \n\n\n\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Spacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3SpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n <\/div>\n<div id=\"BVDI_CO387346212ID\" class=\"BVDI BVDI_CO BVDI_CONoComments\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_COInside\"><div class=\"BVDIHeader BVDI_COHeader\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorContentBodyBottom\"><\/div><\/span><\/div><div id=\"BVRRDisplayContentReviewID_385182073\" class=\"BVRRContentReview BVRRDisplayContentReview BVDIContentSyndicated BVRRContentReviewSyndicated BVDI_BAContentVerifiedPurchaser BVRRDisplayContentReviewOdd BVRRDisplayContentReviewLast BVRROdd BVRRLast\"><span itemprop=\"review\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Review\"><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorContentBodyTop\"><\/div>\n\n <div id=\"BVSubmissionPopupContainer\" class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Spacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3SpacerTop\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRSyndicatedContentAttribution BVRRSyndicatedReviewAttribution\"><div class=\"BVRRSyndicatedContentSource\">Written by a customer while visiting <span class=BVRR