mUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRRecommendedContainer BVRRRecommendedContainerYes\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRecommendedPrefix\">Recommends this product? <\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRRecommended\">Yes<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRecommendedSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><div class=\"BVRRContextDataValueContainer BVRRContextDataValueGenderContainer BVContextDataGenderMale\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValuePrefix BVRRContextDataValueGenderPrefix\">Gender:<\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRContextDataValue BVRRContextDataValueGender\">Male<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRContextDataValueSuffix BVRRContextDataValueGenderSuffix\"><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Love it!<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">04/21/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-04-21\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReview385182073_5sioqa6lqm5eljkur4ekvl6e8_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Setup was straightforward. Mowing is reliable and lawn looks great. Best lawn care purchase in years.<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeClientResponseContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n \n \n\n\n\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Spacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3SpacerBottom\"><\/div>\n <\/div>\n<div id=\"BVDI_CO385182073ID\" class=\"BVDI BVDI_CO BVDI_CONoComments\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_COInside\"><div class=\"BVDIHeader BVDI_COHeader\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorContentBodyBottom\"><\/div><\/span><\/div> <ul id=\"BVSEO_meta\" style=\"display:none!important\">\n <li data-bvseo=\"bvDateModified\">2026-08-05 T00:34:37.007-05:00<\/li>\n <li data-bvseo=\"ps\">bvseo_pps, prod_bvrr, vn_prr_5.6<\/li>\n <li data-bvseo=\"cp\">cp-1, bvpage1<\/li>\n <li data-bvseo=\"co\">co_hasreviews, tv_4, tr_4<\/li>\n <li data-bvseo=\"cf\">loc_en_US, sid_17817006072, prod, sort_submissionTime<\/li>\n <\/ul>\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingsOnlySummary\"> <div class=\"BVRRRatingsOnlySummaryHeader\">\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingsOnlySummaryTitle\"